## Project Context

This is a **React (Vite SPA)** project using the **Component-Based architecture** (components/hooks/utils/patterns).

## Development

```bash
npm run dev      # Start development server at http://localhost:5173
npm run build    # Production build
npm run preview  # Preview production build
```

## Architecture

```
src/
├── components/   # Reusable UI components (Button, Card, Spinner, etc.)
├── hooks/        # Custom React hooks (useToggle, useDebounce, useFetch, etc.)
├── utils/        # Pure utility functions (format, cn, api-client, etc.)
├── types/        # TypeScript interfaces and types
├── pages/        # Page-level components (one per route)
├── layouts/      # Layout components (MainLayout, AuthLayout, etc.)
├── store/        # Global state management
├── services/     # API service abstractions
└── assets/       # Static files (images, fonts, etc.)
```

## Key Principles

- **Components** are self-contained, reusable building blocks
- **Hooks** encapsulate reusable stateful logic
- **Utils** contain pure functions with no side effects
- **Pages** compose components and hooks into full views
- **Types** define shared TypeScript interfaces across the app
